# Project-local skill install created by `npx skills add` when run inside this repo.
# This repo *distributes* its skill via skills/, so a root .agents/ here is only an install
# artifact — ignore it. (In a normal project you WOULD commit .agents/; see the skill's docs.)
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root so it does NOT ignore examples/**/.agents/.
/.agents/
